# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PII GUARD — see CLAUDE.md hard boundary #3: no real PII, ever.
# All demo data must be synthetic and must live in /demo/families.
# These patterns exist so a real document dragged into the repo by accident
# is not committed. Do not remove them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/uploads/
/private/
*.real.json
*.real.pdf
**/real-families/
**/*-REAL.*
scratch/

# Local JSON store written by lib/store.ts — synthetic case data, never commit.
/.data/
